graph LR
    RHOAIMCP["RHOAI MCP Server<br/>(FastMCP, Python 3.10+)"]

    %% External Dependencies (libraries)
    RHOAIMCP -->|MCP framework| FastMCP["mcp / FastMCP 1.0+"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|K8s API client| K8sPython["kubernetes-python 28.1+"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|plugin system| Pluggy["pluggy 1.4+"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|JWT auth| PyJWT["PyJWT[crypto] 2.12+"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|HTTP client| HTTPX["httpx 0.27+"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|data models| Pydantic["pydantic 2.0+"]

    %% Internal RHOAI/ODH Dependencies (platform)
    RHOAIMCP -->|CRD CRUD| KServe["KServe<br/>(InferenceService,<br/>ServingRuntime)"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|CRD CRUD| KFNotebooks["Kubeflow Notebooks<br/>(Notebook)"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|CRD CRUD| TrainingOp["Kubeflow Training Operator<br/>(TrainJob, TrainingRuntime)"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|CRD CRUD| DSPOp["DSP Operator<br/>(DSPA)"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|REST API| ModelReg["Model Registry /<br/>Model Catalog"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|REST API| Planner["Planner Service"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|CRD Read| DSC["DataScienceCluster"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|CRD Read| AccelProfile["AcceleratorProfile"]

    %% External Services
    RHOAIMCP -->|API server| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP"]
    RHOAIMCP -->|projects, routes,<br/>templates, images| OpenShiftAPI["OpenShift API"]
    RHOAIMCP -.->|JWKS / token validation| OIDCProvider["OIDC Provider<br/>(optional)"]

    %% Reverse dependencies (who integrates with MCP)
    AgentClaude["Claude Desktop /<br/>Claude Code"] -->|MCP client| RHOAIMCP
    AgentOther["MCP-Compatible<br/>AI Agents"] -->|MCP client| RHOAIMCP

